      },
      "message": "fix(2d): name the pass start in its fallback warning, not Adaptive\n\nThe completeness guard of \"Pass starts at\" (2D Offset, 2D Pocket, 3D\npocket) posted the Adaptive text \"Adaptive fell back to Offset rings\".\nStrategyFallback gets a defaulted `cause` (Adaptive | PassStart), set\nfrom the notes by operation::strategy_fallback. The Adaptive text does\nnot change; the MCP kind stays strategy_fallback; an old cache reads as\nthe Adaptive cause.\n\nFixes #3542\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
