      "message": "fix(2d): match the pass-start fallback note after a level prefix\n\n3D pocket (#3618) writes the guard note as \"Z <level>: <note>\", so the\nstart-of-note match missed it and the Adaptive text came back. The guard\nnote and its matcher now share PASS_START_FALLBACK_TAIL; the match reads\nPASS_START_NOTE anywhere and the tail at the end. Pinned for the\nprefixed form in motion and through operation::strategy_fallback.\n\nRefs #3542\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
